about-body = Prefs holds MixOS's preference editors, in the spirit of the AmigaOS Prefs drawer. Applications follows upstream releases through the releases service: installs are per user, verified against their published checksums, and the previous version is kept for rolling back. Appearance sets the session's colour scheme, style, mode, contrast and window frame through the settings service, previewing each change in this window before it is applied.
shortcut-body = Ctrl+1: Applications. Ctrl+2: Appearance. Ctrl+S: apply the appearance. Ctrl+R: refresh the list. Ctrl+Shift+R: check for updates. Ctrl+I: install or update the selected application. Ctrl+Q: quit. F1: shortcuts. Escape: close dialogue.
